Steps to Access AWX Over the Internet Using ngrok
Install ngrok:


sudo snap install ngrok
Authenticate ngrok (Optional but Recommended):

Sign up at ngrok.com and get your auth token.
Run this command to authenticate:

ngrok config add-authtoken YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN
Start the Tunnel:


ngrok http 31689
Access the Dashboard:

Open the URL shown in the terminal (like https://b7e3-121-6-114-235.ngrok-free.app) in your browser.
Keep the Terminal Open:

Leave the ngrok terminal session running to maintain the tunnel.
